$ The guarded-comprehension formulation from Figure 3b of the ModRef 2025 paper
$ "Solver Aided Expansion of Loops to Avoid Generate and Test".

language ESSENCE' 1.0

given n : int(1..)

find class : matrix indexed by [int(1..n)] of int(1..2)

such that
and([
    or([class[a] != class[b], class[b] != class[c], class[c] != class[a]])
    | a : int(1..n), b : int(1..n), c : int(1..n),
      a <= b, b <= c, a**2 + b**2 = c**2
])
